{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_title", "source_sha256": "cd308beb352c6826d685c3a32de3eb993d2d7cb3f051fea8910da3bc984137f8", "ja": "憧れはKAWAII！", "zh": "憧憬着KAWAII！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d2715176dfa244f89eb7011f86d28f1cfb3d93c205f6a2af18c07bf9b2040337", "ja": "レッスン休憩中。961プロの練習施設に\nついて語る響と詩花。未来はリッチな様子に\n心惹かれるが、規則が厳しいと知って辞退。\n961プロに行く機会はないと余裕の響だが、\nそうでもないという詩花の言葉に青ざめる。", "zh": "课程休息中。响和诗花谈起961事务所的练习设施。\n未来被那副豪华的样子吸引，但得知规定很严格后便放弃了。\n响还悠然自得地说自己没有机会去961事务所，\n可听到诗花说并非如此后，脸色顿时变得苍白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5c73cbded004260227b1c4fa97262a55d13b0fa4693a1f434137b370244a7c4e", "ja": "―レッスン　休憩中―", "zh": "―练习 休息中―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "3856bc305d6f24a42907fa084976be18371345aa6a60b7c9acd0c96259f18dce", "ja": "へえ～、961プロってそんなにすごいんだ！？", "zh": "诶～，原来961制作人这么厉害啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "8e144555fcc63af48576d5703eca984afa46ae8d4ce72aa6c709aa488fd91d0f", "ja": "961プロっていうか、自分が行ったのは\n練習施設？みたいなところだけどねっ。", "zh": "与其说是961事务所，倒不如说\n自己去的只是练习设施？那样的地方就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "07dc49c93089ce87a0bac426beb3d642edafd75f3b1db56eec01a08584868fef", "ja": "建物はドーン！って感じで、設備は最新型ばっかりで、\nシャワー室にエアコンもついてたんだぞ！", "zh": "大楼给人的感觉超宏伟！设备也全是最先进的，\n淋浴室里甚至还装着空调呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2205a9054ab1adbce1c0a5d8275a4123e6298d4147e39d7d1465d236df6fcf48", "ja": "ゲスト用のウェルカムドリンクも評判いいんだよ。\n貴音さんも気に入ってくれたの。", "zh": "给来宾准备的欢迎饮料也很受好评哦。贵音也很喜欢呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "7c6368636c98c8f337221f92055df8e5024e3de9b286fbcd1a6e8ee27690c6d5", "ja": "うぇるかむどりんく！？　すごすぎる～！\nいいな～。私も行ってみたいよ～！", "zh": "欢迎饮品！？　太厉害了吧～！\n真好啊～。我也想去看看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "03e0aa40f1a00fd1d9bd80cc115c12ee1eb118c30789c557248264b708d92ad5", "ja": "あっはははは、961プロにスカウトされたら\n行けるかもね！　詩花についていってみる？", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈，要是被961事务所挖掘的话\n说不定就能去了呢！你要不要跟着诗花去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "54822d33bd8f7f29e78e2fd96825e4f50181ef7c4e3e699f477e8ba9d39a39c6", "ja": "え～、それはちょっと。絶対静香ちゃんに怒られるし、\n{$P$}さん泣いちゃいそうだし。", "zh": "诶～，这个还是算了吧。肯定会被静香骂的，{$P$}先生也可能会哭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "5f342d7052f471aff3f484689874301d449ff709c65f4b2b68d345853298eab7", "ja": "おお……。\nなんか、すごい自信だぞ……。", "zh": "哦哦……  \n感觉自信满满的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "3164650686c1d39744b2e83179a2184f1aae858da52534bf114c394033591cdf", "ja": "でも、行くだけ行ってみたいな～。\nきっと生クリームのお菓子とかもありますよね？", "zh": "不过，还是想去看看呢～  \n那里肯定也有鲜奶油甜点之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "bdf772eb14b5212e7a175c0c480757e70e91db8816fa6e926e550dd0268f4d52", "ja": "うん、たくさん♪　でもレッスン中は食べられないよ？\nレッスンルームはお菓子持ち込み禁止なの。", "zh": "嗯，有很多♪不过上课的时候不能吃哦？\n练习室禁止带点心进去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "ac0f22f5dd3e09be4b0ce6a93ce16fdfd40197db2d2ae180553f594500e393bc", "ja": "え？　……えええええっ、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "咦？……诶诶诶诶诶，原来是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1012_201xxx", "source_sha256": "a5ce9da501f0c0796fb99e98d5bc61a0566af2d007ddc6262568a1dd239c8e63", "ja": "765プロのみなさんは、休憩中によくお菓子を持ち\n寄って食べてるよね。最初はびっくりしちゃった。", "zh": "765事务所的大家，在休息时经常会各自带点心\n聚在一起吃呢。一开始真的吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "c7f0ede1457789ee9691c5728dca5e2efb14bcb804ccc2b98abb322f9ea15dad", "ja": "だっておいしいんだもん。\n961プロでは、お腹すいたらどうするんですか……？", "zh": "因为好吃嘛。  \n961事务所里，肚子饿了会怎么办呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1014_201xxx", "source_sha256": "3888806774271a7d19ae1b6613ad9691448a7149f0dfe8ac08ccd46148ab3411", "ja": "食事も摂れるラウンジがあって、そこでかな。\nでもヘルシーなメニューだけで、お菓子はありません♪", "zh": "有个可以吃饭的休息室，我应该会去那里吧。\n不过只有健康菜单，没有零食♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "63b35d94b2d63202920079668b833a87bc353951e37e9d399f0ea7ba0ee84689", "ja": "えー……。\n響さん、私、そんなのヤダ……！", "zh": "诶……。\n响学姐，我才不要那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "5888c744ee9a2558c3d2ec0ea82beb2af85db55e1af0bbfe4fe1b3758bb3cda8", "ja": "う、うん。でも大丈夫だぞっ。\nまだ呼ばれてないし！", "zh": "嗯、嗯。不过没事的啦！\n现在还没叫到我们呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "bfc1c9584c72400177ee5714ba083e2080af49d27466d436d321949a2fc019ba", "ja": "自分もすごいステージをみせつけたところだから、\nビビッて当分呼ばれないはずさー！", "zh": "我刚刚也展示了超厉害的舞台，他们肯定吓得暂时不敢叫我了啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1018_201xxx", "source_sha256": "7e0ae442545bed593b1606423660d2c8972582edb35afba5a78968d095f25683", "ja": "ふふっ、そんなことないと思うよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，我觉得不是那样哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "1134832723ed2f4cad58cb6a8d9224eea12eb6f7f39cf79ecc5c49d10a8aeec0", "ja": "えっ？　ど、どうして？", "zh": "诶？为、为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1020_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6a59b0b8da2b5603fdca77070e97b8c0a94145fc17741f699e5e9fab5527555e", "ja": "うちの社長は響ちゃん達のこと、すっごく気に入って\nいるから。……すごいステージをしたなら当然でしょ？", "zh": "我们社长非常喜欢响她们哦。\n……既然呈现了那么棒的舞台，这也是理所当然的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1021_201xxx", "source_sha256": "991e8d09647a4a7c1e3a5e40c6d0da58226787126a20a8f9b65cf9b4b37d1924", "ja": "いつかまた声をかけるかも。\nふふっ、楽しみに待っていてね♪", "zh": "说不定哪天还会去联络你们呢。\n呵呵，好好期待着吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_013hib_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "801a038eb97092f271e1ba6b7c26f2f157817a57c36ff4064202f2ce635803a2", "ja": "うぎゃー！　なんでそうなるの！？\n自分は765プロがいいって言ったのに～！！", "zh": "呜哇——！怎么会变成这样啦！？\n明明我都说了想去765事务所～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
